'''Boulders''' are NPCs that spawn during the fight with [[Ba-Ba]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. When encountered, they will all have the same health, which scales depending on team size and path level, but one will be cracked. Players will always hit their [[Ranged]] max hit on the cracked version.

[[File:Tombs of Amascut - Ba-Ba boulders.png|thumb|left|A player attacking a cracked boulder]]

==Hitpoints scaling==
Team size only has a 50% effect on health scaling for the boulders when compared to other NPCs found within [[Tombs of Amascut]]. For example, a 2-man raid would scale the HP of most NPCs up to 190% but the boulders only scale up to 145%.

Path level also scales the boulders' HP differently. Rather than their HP increasing by 8% at path level 1 and increasing to 13%, 18% etc at path level 2 and 3 respectively, boulders have their HP increased by 10% at path levels 2 and 3. And at path levels 4 and above, the boulders have their HP increased by 25%. This is done after the team size scaling step.

